🏛️ Mega University

🌍 Mega University Purpose

DreamVerse Mega University sirf ek college nahi hai.
Ye poori duniya ke players ke liye ek University District hoga.
Yahan player:

🎓 Degree le sakta hai.

📚 Skills seekh sakta hai.

💼 Career prepare kar sakta hai.

🤖 AI Teacher se padh sakta hai.

🌍 Different colleges join kar sakta hai.

🧪 Practical training kar sakta hai.

🏆 Future jobs unlock kar sakta hai.

University ka design real life aur gameplay dono ko balance karega.

