🪪 College Entry Rules

Campus District me sab freely ghoom sakte hain.

Lekin:

🏢 College Building ke andar jane ke liye:

✔️ Us college ka Student ID Card hona zaruri hai.

Example:

Player Engineering Student hai.

✅ Engineering Building me ja sakta hai.

❌ Medical College ke andar normally nahi ja sakta.

Guard bolega:

> "Aapke paas is college ka valid ID nahi hai."




